cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this training pipeline or a model trained with it, please cite Foveacast and credit the upstream datasets and architectures."
title: "foveacast-training"
abstract: >
  Training pipeline for saliency models shipped in Foveacast.
  Fine-tunes MSI-Net (Kroner et al., 2020) on the UEyes dataset
  (Jiang et al., 2023) to produce a UI-content-aware attention
  prediction model.
